        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Soap.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap is a movement platformer built on old-school FPS mechanics — bunnyhopping, strafing, and pure flow. It’s all about finding your rhythm, shaving seconds, and enjoying the ride as you get smoother with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season brings its own unique world and vibe:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 1</strong> drops you into a neon paradise of tight nightclub-like settings, pulsing with thumping techno and house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 2</strong> shifts into bright outdoor spaces with a breakcore edge — a classic aesthetic inspired by the early Counter-Strike surf maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 3</strong> will be a new surprize aesthetic released at the end of the year! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/94ed3903b0a17466757be5f49ea6283c.avif?t=1766502535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map features its own original soundtrack, with tracks produced specifically to capture the feel of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new tutorial makes it easier than ever to dive in, while loads of tweaks and fixes (thanks to community feedback) have helped Soap quickly evolve into something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap is about speed, style, and expression — whether you’re chasing leaderboards or just vibing with the movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Soap.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap is a movement platformer built on old-school FPS mechanics — bunnyhopping, strafing, and pure flow. It’s all about finding your rhythm, shaving seconds, and enjoying the ride as you get smoother with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season brings its own unique world and vibe:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 1</strong> drops you into a neon paradise of tight nightclub-like settings, pulsing with thumping techno and house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 2</strong> shifts into bright outdoor spaces with a breakcore edge — a classic aesthetic inspired by the early Counter-Strike surf maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Season 3</strong> will be a new surprize aesthetic released at the end of the year! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780420/extras/94ed3903b0a17466757be5f49ea6283c.avif?t=1766502535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map features its own original soundtrack, with tracks produced specifically to capture the feel of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new tutorial makes it easier than ever to dive in, while loads of tweaks and fixes (thanks to community feedback) have helped Soap quickly evolve into something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap is about speed, style, and expression — whether you’re chasing leaderboards or just vibing with the movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Soap is a unique BHOP platformer featuring satisfying gameplay, polished physics, a full original soundtrack, and the dedication of a passionate solo developer.",
